           66 |      6 |             0 | Approved | PO       | PO
           66 |      7 |             0 | Approved | PO       | PO
           66 |      1 |             1 | Approved | Canceled | Canceled
           66 |      8 |             0 | Approved | PO       | PO
           66 |      1 |             0 | Approved | Approved | Approved
           77 |      1 |             0 | Approved | Approved | Approved
            1 |      1 |             0 | ---      | ---      | ---
           66 |      1 |             0 | Approved | Approved | Approved
            1 |      1 |             0 | ---      | ---      | ---
